  "summary_en": "Chinese State Council and Central Military Commission regulation (Decree No. 808, effective 15 September 2025) on protecting key military-industrial facilities through protection zones, access controls, restrictions on photography and overflight, manager duties, and penalties. It contains no AI or robotics provisions.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Defines important military-industrial facilities and establishes protection zones and outer security control areas.",
   "Prohibits unauthorized entry, photography, surveying, and unapproved aircraft flights over protection zones.",
   "Facility managers must implement protection systems, emergency plans, risk assessments, and cyber/data security.",
   "Sets administrative, public security and criminal penalties for violations.",
   "Takes effect 15 September 2025."
